<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My Master, lead me to Thy door;</l><l>Pierce this now willing ear once more;</l><l>Thy bonds are freedom; let me stay</l><l>With Thee, to toil, endure, obey.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yes, ear and hand, and thought and will,</l><l>Use all in Thy dear slav’ry still!</l><l>Self’s weary liberties I cast</l><l>Beneath Thy feet; there keep them fast.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Tread them still down; and then I know,</l><l>These hands shall with Thy gifts o’erflow;</l><l>And pierced ears shall hear the tone</l><l>Which tells me Thou and I are one.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
